# Section Block Radius

- For visible content blocks inside sections, use the same corner radius as the `FeaturedProject` image cards.
- Default pattern: `rounded-md lg:rounded-[0.54rem]`.
- Apply this to section cards, panels, image wrappers, portfolio items, trust blocks, metric blocks, and similar premium content containers.
- Do not introduce larger radii such as `rounded-2xl`, `rounded-3xl`, or custom panel radii for section blocks unless the design system is intentionally updated.
- Small UI controls, badges, pills, buttons, and icon containers may keep their existing component-specific radius.

```tsx
// Preferred for section blocks
<div className="overflow-hidden rounded-md lg:rounded-[0.54rem]">
  ...
</div>
```
